    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Talons of the Emperor",
    "summary": "This rule grants two auras:\n\n- Your **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** units have **Null Aegis (Aura)**: models in an **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit within 6\" of such a unit have **[Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** against **mortal wounds** and Psychic Attacks.\n- Every other **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit of yours has **Deadly Unity (Aura)**: models in an **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit within 6\" of it get +1 to their **Hit rolls**.\n\nNeither aura says the unit it affects must be friendly.",
